{
  "uid": "qc-investigacao",
  "title": "Investigação · Incidente",
  "description": "Do alerta ao log e do log ao trace: qual versão atendeu na AWS, quando mudou e qual requisição errou.",
  "tags": [
    "quantum-assistente",
    "demo-5.2",
    "aws"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "liveNow": false,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m"
    ]
  },
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "quantum-assistente"
      ],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "title": "Outras visões",
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "name": "Alertas disparando",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#F04E5E",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "expr": "max by (alertname, severity) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", severity=~\"warning|critical\"}) unless max by (alertname, severity) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", severity=~\"warning|critical\"} offset 10s)",
        "step": "10s",
        "titleFormat": "Alerta acendeu: {{alertname}}",
        "textFormat": "severidade {{severity}}",
        "useValueForTime": false,
        "hide": false
      },
      {
        "name": "Monitor de qualidade mudou de estado",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#ED145B",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "expr": "{service_name=\"qc-quality-monitor\"} | json",
        "instant": false,
        "titleFormat": "Monitor: {{level}}",
        "textFormat": "n={{n}} janela={{window}}",
        "tagKeys": "",
        "hide": false
      },
      {
        "name": "Nova combinação de versões vista pelos probes",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#5BC8D9",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "expr": "count by (release_id, graph_version) (qc_probe_observed_version{environment=~\"$environment\"}) unless count by (release_id, graph_version) (qc_probe_observed_version{environment=~\"$environment\"} offset 30s)",
        "step": "15s",
        "titleFormat": "Versões vistas: release {{release_id}}",
        "textFormat": "graph_version {{graph_version}}",
        "useValueForTime": false,
        "hide": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "label": "Ambiente",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values({__name__=~\"qc_requests_total|qc_probe_total\"}, environment)",
          "refId": "environment"
        },
        "definition": "label_values({__name__=~\"qc_requests_total|qc_probe_total\"}, environment)",
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": {
          "text": "live",
          "value": "live"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "release",
        "label": "Release",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(qc_probe_total{environment=~\"$environment\"}, release_id)",
          "refId": "release"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(qc_probe_total{environment=~\"$environment\"}, release_id)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "allValue": ".*"
      },
      {
        "name": "scenario_id",
        "label": "Cenário dos probes",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(qc_quality_status, scenario_id)",
          "refId": "scenario_id"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(qc_quality_status, scenario_id)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": {
          "text": "live_watch",
          "value": "live_watch"
        },
        "allValue": ".*"
      },
      {
        "name": "busca",
        "label": "Buscar no log (caso, motivo)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "trace_id",
        "label": "trace_id",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Como investigar",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "transparent": false,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "1. Escolha o **ambiente** (live), o **cenário dos probes** e o **release** no topo. A tabela ao lado mostra as combinações de versões que os probes encontraram no período.\n2. Na **linha do tempo**, veja quando o alerta acendeu e quando apagou.\n3. Nos **logs**, procure `probe fail`. Clique na linha e depois em **Ver este trace (Jaeger) no painel**, ao lado do `trace_id`.\n4. O trace abre em tela cheia (ou na faixa *Trace da requisição escolhida*). Leia os spans `graph.traverse` e `policy.version.filter`: atributos `qc.selected_doc_version`, `qc.graph_version` e `qc.path_hops`.\n5. A UI completa do Jaeger não é pública: abra com o túnel do SSM na porta 16686.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Versões observadas pelos probes",
      "description": "Cada combinação de release, corpus e grafo que os probes viram respondendo no período, com o primeiro e o último instante em que apareceu.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (environment, release_id, graph_version, graph_seed_version, corpus_version) (max_over_time(qc_probe_observed_version{environment=~\"$environment\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "min by (environment, release_id, graph_version, graph_seed_version, corpus_version) (min_over_time(timestamp(qc_probe_observed_version{environment=~\"$environment\"})[$__range:15s])) * 1000",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (environment, release_id, graph_version, graph_seed_version, corpus_version) (max_over_time(timestamp(qc_probe_observed_version{environment=~\"$environment\"})[$__range:15s])) * 1000",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value #A": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "environment": "Ambiente",
              "release_id": "Release",
              "corpus_version": "Corpus",
              "graph_version": "graph_version",
              "graph_seed_version": "graph_seed_version",
              "Value #B": "Visto pela 1a vez",
              "Value #C": "Visto por último"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "environment": 0,
              "release_id": 1,
              "corpus_version": 2,
              "graph_version": 3,
              "graph_seed_version": 4,
              "Value #B": 5,
              "Value #C": 6
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Visto por último",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Sem medição no período",
          "custom": {
            "align": "left",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "Visto.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeAsLocal"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "graph_.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5BC8D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Linha do tempo do incidente",
      "description": "Cada faixa é um alerta do Prometheus: colorida enquanto está disparando.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (alertname) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", alertname!=\"QualityInsufficientData\"})",
